  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studie av Niassasj&#xf6;ns strandkants tillbakadragande</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study of the withdrawal of the shoreline of Lake Niassa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing of study of the shore of Lake Niassa. The shoreline has exhibited withdrawal during 2023, leading to damage on nature and infrastructure.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiering till studie av Niassasj&#xf6;ns strandkant d&#xe5; den dragit sig tillbaka kraftigt under 2023. Tillbakadragandet har orsakat skada p&#xe5; natur och infrastruktur l&#xe4;ngs sj&#xf6;n.</narrative>
  </description>
